, such as metadata or descriptions related to the image. This ensures that any textual information is properly formatted and free of errors.\\n*   **Skin Cancer Detection:** This is the core model node. It utilizes a pre-trained or fine-tuned model to analyze the image and identify potential signs of skin cancer.\\n*   **Confusion Matrix Calculator:** This node evaluates the performance of the `Skin Cancer Detection` model by calculating the confusion matrix. This matrix provides insights into the model's accuracy, precision, recall, and other relevant metrics.\\n*   **PDF File Exporter:** This node generates a PDF report containing the analysis results, including the model's predictions, confidence scores, and the evaluation metrics from the confusion matrix. This report provides a comprehensive overview of the skin cancer detection process.\\nANSWER_END\\n\\nProcess exited with code 0.\"}],\"details\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"sessionId\":\"dawn-lobster\",\"exitCode\":0,\"aggregated\":\"dict_keys(['status', 'metadata', 'data'])\\nstatus= 200\\nmetadata= {'name': 'AutoGen-model', 'type': 'ai_tool.AutoGen-model', 'run_id': 'debug', 'workflow_name': 'OpenClaw Pipeline Generator', 'workflow_type': 'prototype', 'workflow_id': '15657162-4ef2-4e04-8326-bf54e71ec6a2', 'workflow_run_id': '15657162-4ef2-4e04-8326-bf54e71ec6a2'}\\ndata type= dict\\ndata keys= dict_keys(['Answer', 'Perplexity Score', 'ImageBase64'])\\nANSWER_START\\nNode Explanation:\\n\\n*   **Image Reader:** This node is responsible for loading the image file. It handles various image formats and prepares the image data for subsequent processing.\\n*   **Text Cleaner:** This node is used to clean any associated text data, such as metadata or descriptions related to the image. This ensures that any textual information is properly formatted and free of errors.\\n*   **Skin Cancer Detection:** This is the core model node. It utilizes a pre-trained or fine-tuned model to analyze the image and identify potential signs of skin cancer.\\n*   **Confusion Matrix Calculator:** This node evaluates the performance of the `Skin Cancer Detection` model by calculating the confusion matrix. This matrix provides insights into the model's accuracy, precision, recall, and other relevant metrics.\\n*   **PDF File Exporter:** This node generates a PDF report containing the analysis results, including the model's predictions, confidence scores, and the evaluation metrics from the confusion matrix. This report provides a comprehensive overview of the skin cancer detection process.\\nANSWER_END\\n\",\"name\":\"python3 <<'PY'\"},\"isError\":false,\"timestamp\":1773089480622}}\n/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/b876b364-8f1e-42cc-81f6-27a9da8bd227.jsonl.reset.2026-03-09T21-37-53.630Z:38:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"85d42f05\",\"parentId\":\"756a806a\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-09T20:51:30.923Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"\",\"thinkingSignature\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0a7b28860b6f9d620169af32cb3a80819198dd290603a35a0c\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"encrypted_content\\\":\\\"gAAAAABprzLMkhbSF9-omBtTu4_2LHomw1xCJKYMPnIHgb2VPFUIwmqHbhTctl6nTQw_twsAI2EgUWAEStckXjxim8uGccdXsDDrz1XpKHfSFNbYhOWDLBVB_l2obFxkB7deKRXECpcv004u3uREeBTjyngQgcEp6iKaMxrCXgA_dy5TV9-isT6hizLkTv29aNQegHtdwVIrkybJtLU8iwYIHevw5QkkNP12GNHJEEYR87-J9gRjlLC6Kmae-vECnqXmw7p-rGTu_SxzWWr0I5dp9VYvpNOasfX3uk7kSQze6ljS6Yn3kHDIfFnLCDtQ-q7P2UdluG5Y5tG50CBj2QCNa_cnowBlRd1vPPiFTamkSQ1y2YeiaMRFQxhMuOBbbHhEipVuQN1E8aualDs3XwE7DlVz4bKy2LZqeNL0bMPsGtgzkWTO56vFtYs5mZLhMnQEMghbwzH7mEMXZ1kqwavCCtHWiws7Dd2FIacWY6BBpZhYPtM6lcIbKbzloZTGs65hr83BVPPjXwRiA4QEv3zotIecdrDhrMG6GQYrYk6way2ImdBpwkG1F0qsHFuHoZmI1HLoR4wCdcK9Zag70mop0_XV6_oTrRy_h5AT9fDT06zG8lfATuERt1ijyf2RS2OwPRXcpwCtqy0lremCVRrEqAZ3bDVT3ke2nOPEpDdlickBBJ8vgizOQf9e8tTCCdRWci3S2vzsr5RhhWueoc4Vyg_HZpFponIffxbIOPzdoUa3qSfOQveS_s2Etj7FSzFT4fN4t_d5_8-v3pucF6_qOIAWU7b_Vt-bHZtAdoVqA4LaCDImpoIwiDs1xLt-MROmxRlyQu8kMkYtfM-J_jplbS540DIxVudXG9tvTYmL-uSTPTa6P764ghHjZQPiE9v11SNogJ7dn0MM5DF51ZC9QAcoRv68sZQkOVfU5PXUEcd_QVRV9p5f3jGb4PFEUE1fMehWDrROst8_stDoPLR6bwoimSQvgISxprhpn7Kl3mTDnIGAcOBNVKV3lRvv7l-sRFUMnu2yiuEMElt4Kt2NmtLEg_yBg8dRuEu4E3BsYN1MzFiSOtiBSl-pw4PzvHUekHy2gNfk\\\",\\\"summary\\\":[]}\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"[[reply_to_current]] Here’s the generated ML pipeline prototype.\\n\\n**Generated pipeline (raw)**  \\n- **Image Reader** — loads the image file  \\n- **Text Cleaner** — cleans any related metadata/description text  \\n- **Skin Cancer Detection** — core image model for lesion classification/detection  \\n- **Confusion Matrix Calculator** — evaluates model performance  \\n- **PDF File Exporter** — outputs a report with predictions and metrics  \\n\\n**High-level explanation**\\n- **Objective:** Start from a skin image file and run a model that predicts whether the lesion is suspicious for skin cancer.\\n- **Data flow:**  \\n  1. Read the image  \\n  2. Optionally clean attached metadata/text  \\n  3. Send image into the skin-cancer model  \\n  4. Compare predictions against labels in evaluation mode  \\n  5. Export a summary report\\n- **Model/training approach:**  \\n  The prototype assumes a pre-trained or fine-tuned skin-cancer vision model is the main inference component.\\n- **Evaluation:**  \\n  The confusion matrix stage suggests standard supervised evaluation using true/false positives and negatives, which supports metrics like accuracy, precision, recall, and sensitivity.\\n- **Deployment/reporting idea:**  \\n  The PDF export step implies a lightweight reporting workflow for clinicians, researchers, or QA review.\\n\\n**Notes**\\n- This is a **high-level prototype**, not a full production pipeline.\\n- For a real medical workflow, I’d add explicit steps for:\\n  - image normalization/resizing\\n  - train/validation/test split\\n  - augmentation\\n  - probability thresholding\\n  - calibration\\n  - human-review gate\\n  - monitoring for drift and false negatives\\n\\nIf you want, I can also turn this into a **more complete end-to-end pipeline** with training, inference API, and deployment monitoring stages.\",\"textSignature\":\"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0a7b28860b6f9d620169af32cc21748191b9904f83734adf0a\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"}],\"api\":\"openai-codex-responses\",\"provider\":\"openai-codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"usage\":{\"input\":522,\"output\":418,\"cacheRead\":151424,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":152364,\"cost\":{\"input\":0.0013050000000000002,\"output\":0.00627,\"cacheRead\":0.037856,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0.045431}},\"stopReason\":\"stop\",\"timestamp\":1773089480630}}\n/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/5429323c-5a9e-4293-a918-2c960eb22768.jsonl.reset.2026-03-17T17-55-50.135Z:13:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"37b11926\",\"parentId\":\"c4930db4\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-09T20:38:08.707Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"message_id\\\": \\\"155\\\",\\n  \\\"sender_id\\\": \\\"495506013\\\",\\n  \\\"sender\\\": \\\"Matteo Cicalese\\\",\\n  \\\"timestamp\\\": \\\"Mon 2026-03-09 20:38 UTC\\\",\\n  \\\"was_mentioned\\\": true\\n}\\n```\\n\\nSender (untrusted metadata):\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"label\\\": \\\"Matteo Cicalese (495506013)\\\",\\n  \\\"id\\\": \\\"495506013\\\",\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"Matteo Cicalese\\\",\\n  \\\"username\\\": \\\"CicaMatt\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n/pipeline_generator generate ML pipeline showing a skin cancer detection performed starting from an image file\"}],\"timestamp\":1773088688706}}\n/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/5429323c-5a9e-4293-a918-2c960eb22768.jsonl.reset.2026-03-17T17-55-50.135Z:16:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"870b5605\",\"parentId\":\"8c316f53\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-09T20:38:16.340Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"\",\"thinkingSignature\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_051e1834c7459b