64d3ed778df\",\"toolName\":\"exec\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Node Explanation:\\n\\n*   **Image Reader:** This node is responsible for ingesting the raw image data. It assumes that the images are stored in a standard format (e.g., JPEG, PNG) and are accessible through a file path or directory.\\n*   **Text Cleaner:** This node is included to handle any textual metadata associated with the images (e.g., patient ID, date of capture). Cleaning this metadata can improve the quality of any subsequent feature engineering steps.\\n*   **Tokenizer:** Tokenizes the image metadata (if available) for potential feature engineering.\\n*   **Skin Cancer Detection:** This node represents the core machine learning model. It leverages a CNN architecture, which is well-suited for image analysis tasks. Fine-tuning a pre-trained model on a skin cancer dataset allows for efficient learning and improved performance. The assumption here is that a labeled dataset of dermoscopic images is available for training.\\n*   **Confusion Matrix Calculator:** This node calculates the confusion matrix, providing a detailed breakdown of the model's classification performance. It helps identify areas where the model may be struggling (e.g., misclassifying benign lesions as cancerous).\\n*   **ROC Curve:** This node generates an ROC curve, which visually represents the model's ability to discriminate between cancerous and non-cancerous lesions. It provides a measure of the model's overall diagnostic accuracy.\"}],\"details\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"exitCode\":0,\"durationMs\":27,\"aggregated\":\"Node Explanation:\\n\\n*   **Image Reader:** This node is responsible for ingesting the raw image data. It assumes that the images are stored in a standard format (e.g., JPEG, PNG) and are accessible through a file path or directory.\\n*   **Text Cleaner:** This node is included to handle any textual metadata associated with the images (e.g., patient ID, date of capture). Cleaning this metadata can improve the quality of any subsequent feature engineering steps.\\n*   **Tokenizer:** Tokenizes the image metadata (if available) for potential feature engineering.\\n*   **Skin Cancer Detection:** This node represents the core machine learning model. It leverages a CNN architecture, which is well-suited for image analysis tasks. Fine-tuning a pre-trained model on a skin cancer dataset allows for efficient learning and improved performance. The assumption here is that a labeled dataset of dermoscopic images is available for training.\\n*   **Confusion Matrix Calculator:** This node calculates the confusion matrix, providing a detailed breakdown of the model's classification performance. It helps identify areas where the model may be struggling (e.g., misclassifying benign lesions as cancerous).\\n*   **ROC Curve:** This node generates an ROC curve, which visually represents the model's ability to discriminate between cancerous and non-cancerous lesions. It provides a measure of the model's overall diagnostic accuracy.\",\"cwd\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace\"},\"isError\":false,\"timestamp\":1773088811986}}\n/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/5429323c-5a9e-4293-a918-2c960eb22768.jsonl.reset.2026-03-17T17-55-50.135Z:38:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"039e012f\",\"parentId\":\"655fcff2\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-09T20:40:24.443Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"**Considering final thoughts in Italian**\\n\\nI’m thinking I might need to finalize something in Italian. I should clarify what exactly I want to say and highlight the assumptions behind it. It’s important for me to make sure that I'm not leaving anything out and to keep my thoughts organized. I’ll aim to be clear and concise in whatever I'm preparing, while still considering the nuances of the language and context.\",\"thinkingSignature\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_051e1834c7459b290169af302cfe5c8191ad8b4a6b524c7163\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning\\\",\\\"encrypted_content\\\":\\\"gAAAAABprzAuMr-EVU3E_YfOBG66y60uo02cWAPQT941umG2MjjYSKg6CtZJ2S9GA28vj2R4lJI4YxJxRed3odoO6a8yVdOx_VBK3LY3HEKXyGZxMidOv6M7cRMl-RD9lGnA75b4iFGsg1E8sTHW-aNcS-cij7-kcAdYzFZuEBAIjNOl2aD4culDk6YcjPmCEclrRiviVGcYjeG-jEai9LSs3tVqqArn-ss-LEsraDh1XIwJr3ywH891w4Npl_Y_dAZCBy6N3dN7Z9tOxgVx6OLTVyxVAAtDaw9E4H7g2sR2LYe-X_RAX98sZZ2HEFyUtqgeF5L54-xIcQAoV35kdIkOuqRf1LeAXYtx_qkusr_ryyYSrGH5UlIbfeRzSP5UZmFv087S3-JDaGvVDYq0IkfMr4yTJfygLJun-JE2QSgFoUdmw3g76Kgk7u8PJSaX2ihEc83NGu9v-vaa8c440Y2IqgV8zHZWh8TOvZiWaS8-LkJXo9RT8h2TwxvA2tzyd3n4zVB45m3Nh0ldH-_U254ccVTAKa5Wh3uSHtibI5VwZIBpKKVKi7qBynIOUltLSRlJw3CkoVOoMQGq_ISBRNDarGADaPxbkXMvAvyMj_7B3w0rRUgrA7IT-4N-8-tgFlYvGVP-ZFBasdJr9UCFoYRyT1_Z84mwLzcCHI-6rtZIm7hAPRa5AN7flZsuHGXgIf8XaDN6jMMBB95OJ7FutEh2p_RHYUf6eNk4vGsNFs39C36CWXEU4jMgXpzIDPY5IOedImcqVu5kiDVjDJ_CBJMQIpF4FFgjHkODuY21eTPGTG0UYDTi_J7O8-Kckh-WJGL-E3Dcj5DpNegCuhq5IevV_a7l790JYJ8wth3U9g-drKkoA_QC_fh9NxGIA4QTZ52dM8zf6ON8e-kv1Dvkl55x48i_0973kA==\\\",\\\"summary\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"summary_text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"**Considering final thoughts in Italian**\\\\n\\\\nI’m thinking I might need to finalize something in Italian. I should clarify what exactly I want to say and highlight the assumptions behind it. It’s important for me to make sure that I'm not leaving anything out and to keep my thoughts organized. I’ll aim to be clear and concise in whatever I'm preparing, while still considering the nuances of the language and context.\\\"}]}\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"[[reply_to_current]] **Pipeline generata (raw)**  \\nEstratto del risultato del generatore:\\n\\n- **Image Reader**: legge il file immagine in input  \\n- **Text Cleaner / Tokenizer**: puliscono ed eventualmente strutturano metadati testuali associati all’immagine  \\n- **Skin Cancer Detection**: modello centrale basato su **CNN**, con possibile **fine-tuning di un modello pre-addestrato**  \\n- **Confusion Matrix Calculator**: valuta gli errori di classificazione  \\n- **ROC Curve**: misura la capacità discriminativa del modello\\n\\n**Spiegazione ad alto livello**\\n\\n1. **Input**\\n   - Si parte da un file immagine della lesione cutanea, per esempio dermoscopica o clinica.\\n\\n2. **Preprocessing**\\n   - Normalizzazione dell’immagine, ridimensionamento, pulizia dei dati.\\n   - Se presenti, i metadati vengono ripuliti e resi utilizzabili.\\n\\n3. **Rilevazione / classificazione**\\n   - Il cuore della pipeline è un modello di visione, tipicamente una **CNN** o una rete pre-addestrata fine-tunata sul task.\\n   - Obiettivo: classificare la lesione, ad esempio **benigna vs sospetta/maligna**.\\n\\n4. **Training**\\n   - Addestramento supervisionato su immagini etichettate.\\n   - In pratica sarebbe utile includere anche:\\n     - data augmentation\\n     - split train/validation/test\\n     - bilanciamento classi\\n\\n5. **Valutazione**\\n   - La pipeline proposta mette enfasi su:\\n     - **confusion matrix**\\n     - **ROC curve / AUC**\\n   - Per un caso medico io considererei anche:\\n     - **sensibilità (recall)**\\n     - **specificità**\\n     - **precision**\\n     - **F1-score**\\n\\n6. **Inferenza**\\n   - Nuova immagine → preprocessing → modello → probabilità di rischio / classe predetta.\\n\\n7. **Deployment e monitoraggio**\\n   - Servizio di inferenza che riceve un file immagine.\\n   - Logging delle predizioni e monitoraggio drift / performance nel tempo.\\n\\n**Assunzioni**\\n- Sono disponibili immagini dermatologiche etichettate.\\n- Il task è una **classificazione preliminare automatica**, non una diagnosi clinica definitiva.\\n- Eventuali metadati associati all’immagine possono essere usati come feature aggiuntive.\\n\\n**Nota importante**\\nPer un contesto sanitario, questa pipeline va considerata come **supporto preliminare**: non sostituisce la valutazione dermatologica o istopatologica.\\n\\nSe vuoi, posso anche trasformarla in una versione più concreta, ad esempio:\\n- **pipeline tipo ResNet/EfficientNet**\\n- **pipeline con segmentazione della lesione + classificazione**\\n- **diagramma step-by-step pronto per documentazione o tesi**\",\"textSignature\":\"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_051e1834c7459b290169af302e90108191a55a812213e8fbfb\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"}],\"api\":\"openai-codex-responses\",\"provider\":\"openai-codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.4\",\"usage\":{\"input\":392,\"output\":628,\"cacheRead\":29440,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"totalTokens\":30460,\"cost\":{\"input\":0.0009800000000000002,\"output\":0.00942,\"cacheRead\":0.007359999999999999,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0.017759999999999998}},\"stopReason\":\"stop\",\"timestamp\":1773088811988}}\n/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/7c58fbb7-7266-44c4-a578-4eec225bc67e.jsonl.reset.2026-03-31T13-33-11.470Z:7:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"dd43dcdc\",\"parentId\":\"fc42ed80\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-31T13:31:50.328Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"[media attached: /home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/file_9---22d160af-8b90-4476-8931-ac57b0b9876d.jpg (image/jpeg) | /home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/file_9---22d160af-8b90-4476-8931-ac57b0b9876d.jpg]\\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"message_id\\\": \\\"572\\\",\\n  \\\"sender_id\\\": \\\"495506013\\\",\\n  \\\"sender\\\": \\\"Matteo Cicalese\\\",\\n  \\\"timestamp\\\": \\\"Tue 2026-03-31 13:31 UTC\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\nSender (untrusted metadata):\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"label\\\": \\\"Matteo Cicalese (495506013)\\\",\\n  \\\"id\\\": \\\"495506013\\\",\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"Matteo Cicalese\\\",\\n  \\\"username\\\": \\\"CicaMatt\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\ntest the skin cancer pipeline with this 